### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### PARKIRIN REST API — PENGUJIAN AUTENTIKASI SANCTUM
### ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api

### 1. Registrasi Pengendara Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama_lengkap": "Pengendara Baru",
  "email": "pengendara.baru@example.com",
  "username": "pengendarabaru",
  "no_telepon": "081234567899",
  "password": "password123",
  "password_confirmation": "password123"
}

###

### 2. Login Pengendara (Customer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ahmadfauzi",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 3. Login Staf (Super Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guard": "user",
  "username": "superadmin",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 4. Login Staf (Petugas Pos Gambir)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guard": "user",
  "username": "petugas_gambir",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 5. Logout (Revoke Token)
# Ganti token di bawah ini dengan token yang didapatkan dari response login di atas
@authToken = 1|zwKWS9LxhROl4ZVX0MSSVFDQjLVBgipX4BSrWjX376d757d3

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
